Hi Team,

Please review each tab in the attached Release Report and take the required action.

1. Commit Violations

* Review the Commit Violations tab.
* Select your Scrum Team and review all violations.
* Also review No Scrum Team.
* Update Action as Fixed or Ignore and provide the Justification.

2. Story Status

* Check the Status column.
* For stories that are not Closed, check if they belong to your Scrum Team.
* Take the required action and close the story once completed.

3. Branch Cut Validation

* Check the Branch Cut Status column.
* For anything not marked Branch Cut Completed, please take action and complete the branch cut.

4. Test Three Deployment

* Check the Deployment Status column.
* For anything not marked Valid, please deploy the branch to Test Three as soon as the code is ready.

Please complete the required actions for all applicable items before the next release.
